cedentCause4Interval'')::int      AS antecedent4_interval_days,\n  (ea.declaration->>''eventDetails_otherSignificantConditionInterval'')::int  AS other_condition_interval_days\n\nFROM event_actions ea;\n"},"middleware":{"js-int-to-string?":true,"userland-query?":true,"add-default-userland-constraints?":true}}');   
